            "notes": "### **\u2728 I'll be watching over you \u2728**\n\n___________________\n\n### \ud83d\udcab POWERS\n\n#### We are not using [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9) just yet as it gets much better once you get some items with it.\n\n#### &nbsp;\n\n| Power | Description |\n| ------ | ------------ |\n| [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) | Great for cash and high support; Make sure to switch between two teammates often enough to heal or boost two people at the same time. |\n| [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) | Pairs well with [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9), which we will be using in Round 3. It boosts all of your healing output (both Weapon and Ability) on low HP allies. |\n\n___________________\n\n### \u2694\ufe0f ITEMS\n\n| Item | Description |\n| ---- | ------------ |\n| [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) | **Survivability**, Health Regen Perk |\n| [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) | **Healing** (5%) |\n| [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) | **Healing** (5%) |\n\nI personally prefer [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) over [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6). I think the health regen perk is better than such a small amount of armor.",
