            "notes": "### **\u2728 Angel at your shoulder! \u2728**\n\nIn Round 2, I suggest going for [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power), [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) and **Survivability**. A good [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da) **must** stay alive.\n\n__________________________\n\n### \u2694\ufe0f ITEMS\n\n| Item | Description |\n| ---- | ---- |\n| [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) | **If you got over $15k in Round 1**, this is an amazing item for Round 2. It will boost your healing by **30%** on critical health allies - assuring their survival |\n| [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) | Increased Survivability \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f |\n| [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) | Increased **Healing** (15%) |\n| [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) | Increased **Healing** (15%) |\n| [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) | Increased **Healing** (10%) and [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) (5%) |\n| [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) | Increased Healing (10%) and [Move Speed](stat_move_speed) (5%) |",
